<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - CATERPILLAR RAISED.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CATERPILLAR RAISED.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch analyst James McCann said on Thursday he raised his rating on Caterpillar Inc to an accumulate from a market perform, with a 12-month price target of $68 per share.</p>
<p>-- &quot;The company is operating in a better environment and has better internals and execution,&quot; McCann said.</p>
<p>-- The stock closed at 58-8/16.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
